  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靈感來源於<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"> <a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">JUST ENOUGH EFFECT DESCRIPTIONS (JEED)</a></span></strong></h4>\n<h4><br>Moderately Enough Effect Descriptions (MEED) 是一款 JEED/EMIffect 擴充套件，為眾多不同的模組提供支援！你能夠發現並了解超過 100 個模組中的 500 種以上狀態效果，並且持續增加中！</h4>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h4>就像 JEED 一樣，你將能夠在 JEI、REI 或 EMI 中查看狀態效果的相關資訊，包括其說明、來源模組、效果顏色，以及會觸發或施加該效果的物品！</h4>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h4>本模組正持續新增對新模組的支援，並將盡快更新以支援最熱門的 Minecraft 版本！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/790/503/638409486810559684.png\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"800\" height=\"414\"></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>目前支援的模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必要：</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h5>擇一安裝：</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEED<br></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emiffect-status-effects-emi-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMIffect</a></span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擇一安裝：</span></h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></p>\n<h5>Fabric 模組專用：</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>選用支援模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<h4><strong>A-C</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (The Aether: Redux)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (Deep Aether)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alshanexs-familiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alshanex's Familiars</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (Ars Additions)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (Ars Elemental)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-bakery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bakery (Legacy)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End (FABRIC)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-makeover-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-and-madness\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood and Madness</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood Magic</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood-rebirth\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (Tome of Blood: Rebirth)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https:/