Respillaged</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden's Nether Expansion</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Monsters</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><strong>M-S</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mahou-tsukai\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahou Tsukai</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium's Soulslike Weaponry</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monobank</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Monsters</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/my-nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">My Nether's Delight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystic-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystic Potions</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-aura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Aura</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-depths-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Depths Upgrade</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Overhaul</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nutritional-balance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nutritional Balance</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/occultism\" re